# The upstream RPCS3 revision this core's emulation code is merged up to.
# The build reports it as the core version (retro_get_system_info's
# library_version, and the build in the log header), so an rpcs3-libretro build
# names the same version as the standalone RPCS3 build it corresponds to:
# upstream's version, then its build number (`git rev-list --count <commit>`).
# The commit of this repository is appended to it at configure time (see
# upstream_version.cmake); it is not recorded here.
#
# Bump both lines in the same commit that merges upstream; CMake warns when the
# recorded commit is not an ancestor of the tree being built.
RPCS3_VERSION=v0.0.43-20400
RPCS3_COMMIT=f848fd1e12aaba4f7c04bbd8642bfb9b5fae556c
